OL,3,GNEWSABuggy driver tells of tragic turn
OL,4,Aat Center Parcs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA holiday park worker who hit and
OL,7,Fkilled a colleague riding a bicycle
OL,8,Fwhile driving a golf buggy at less than
OL,9,F10mph has told a coroner how he had no
OL,10,Ftime to "take evasive action".
OL,12,FJohn Davies, who was working at Center
OL,13,FParcs Woburn Forest, near Ampthill,
OL,14,FBedfordshire, said he was "devastated"
OL,15,Fwhen he learned that housekeeping team
OL,16,Fleader Penny Bulpitt had died.
OL,18,FBulpitt, 67, suffered a "devastating"
OL,19,Fhead injury after being hit from behind
OL,20,Fon a one-way Center Parcs road in
OL,21,FSeptember 2023, an inquest in Ampthill
OL,22,Fhas heard.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
