OL,3,GNEWSABuggy driver tells of tragic turn
OL,4,Aat Center Parcs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bin lorry driver who witnessed the
OL,7,Fcrash said Bulpitt, who was not wearing
OL,8,Fa helmet, "flew in the air", even
OL,9,Fthough the speed involved seemed "very
OL,10,Fslow".
